{"id":"n15292-1-7","stage":5,"title":"갈래 · 分支","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15292-1-7-1","ko":"요즘 어떤 책들을 읽니?","zh":"最近在读什么书啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"책들을","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책들을","audio":"/audio/16cfd2663d63c70085c4.mp3"}},{"text":"읽니?","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"2","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"읽니","audio":"/audio/0ab6cab2c159037fabd9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"阅读","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3","entryId":"68752","definition":"看文字了解其意思。","pronunciation":["익따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7fa304bf66e800113ddf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15292-1-7-2","ko":"갈래에 상관없이 이것저것 읽고 있어.","zh":"不管什么类型的，都在读各种各样的书。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"갈래에","meaning":"分支，分类","explanation":"갈래：分支，分类；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"갈래","audio":"/audio/c41f6da1c603c654d83a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15292","senseId":"1","lemma":"갈래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈래에","audio":"/audio/319fbdbcac8e4e77bce4.mp3"}},{"text":"상관없이","meaning":"不管","explanation":"상관없이：不管","readings":[{"term":"상관없이","audio":"/audio/5dd7b2ac6751141b4e0a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16217","senseId":"2","lemma":"상관없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상관없이","audio":"/audio/5dd7b2ac6751141b4e0a.mp3"}},{"text":"이것저것","meaning":"这那，这个那个","explanation":"이것저것：这那，这个那个","readings":[{"term":"이것저것","audio":"/audio/67e9667690bbec7590cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71129","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것저것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이것저것","audio":"/audio/67e9667690bbec7590cb.mp3"}},{"text":"읽고","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"2","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"읽고","audio":"/audio/9a50865063fb154ddc7d.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c41f6da1c603c654","term":"갈래","zh"